(xvii) there are no beds available in Government as well as Private Hospitals in cities like Bhopal,
Indore, Jabalpur and other places.

A reference in support of this proposition can be made to the judgments of Supreme Court in Pt. Parmanand Katara vs. Union of India (1989) 4 SCC 286;
